      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've run into this as well. I've run into a malicious user who uses the world link system to coordinate raids on a friend group of mine, because someone (we can't really figure out who) has one of their alts friended, and it gets really nasty. At some point they figured out they can just block me and cause hell and even crash others. I've been pretty irritated about it.\nInitially I actually saw one of the VRC staff about it and was dismissed pretty quickly as being childish, so seeing it now makes my cheeks feel a bit hotter.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
